### Job Application Tracker API Tests
### Use REST Client extension in VS Code to run these

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000

###

### Register User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aditya Patil",
  "email": "aditya@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login User
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aditya@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get Current User (Replace TOKEN with your JWT from login)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Create Job Application (Replace TOKEN)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "company": "Google",
  "role": "Software Engineer",
  "link": "https://careers.google.com/jobs/results/123456",
  "location": "Mountain View, CA",
  "appliedDate": "2026-01-15",
  "status": "Applied",
  "notes": "Applied through referral from John"
}

###

### Get All Jobs (Replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Get Job Stats (Replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/stats
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Filter Jobs by Status (Replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs?status=Interview
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Search Jobs (Replace TOKEN)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/jobs?search=Google
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Update Job Application (Replace TOKEN and JOB_ID)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/JOB_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Interview",
  "notes": "Phone screen scheduled for Feb 5th"
}

###

### Delete Job Application (Replace TOKEN and JOB_ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/jobs/JOB_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
